# Regression: the Files tree lists text files in the case root for editing. Its binary check looked for a NUL with
# memchr over strlen() bytes, which can never find one, so a PNG (no byte below 9 before its first NUL) was listed
# as text and opened in the text editor. clang-tidy bugprone-not-null-terminated-result, page_dicts.c.
open $SB/ws/cavity
shell printf '\211PNG\r\n\032\n\000\000\000\rIHDR' > plot.png
shell printf '#!/bin/sh\necho hi\n' > notes.sh
click nav:files
wait-until page Files
wait 30
assert text notes.sh
assert not text plot.png
dump $OUT/files.txt
